# Optional: clients that may relay WITHOUT authentication - one IP or CIDR per
# line, '#' comments allowed. They are still bound by allowed_senders.
# An invalid line, or a /0 network, stops the relay at startup.
# Copy to config/trusted_networks and edit. Apply with: docker compose restart
